cff-version: 1.2.0
title: LiGaMD-OpenMM
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this record and the
  gamd-openmm package it is derived from.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yassir
    family-names: Boulaamane
repository-code: 'https://github.com/yboulaamane/ligamd-openmm'
abstract: >-
  An open-source implementation of ligand Gaussian accelerated molecular
  dynamics (LiGaMD) for OpenMM, adding a ligand-selective non-bonded boost to
  the gamd-openmm package. The ligand's non-bonded interactions are isolated
  into their own force group, with electrostatics evaluated using the Ewald
  real-space term at the system's PME separation parameter.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-09-01'
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - enhanced sampling
  - GaMD
  - LiGaMD
  - OpenMM
  - ligand binding
references:
  - type: software
    title: gamd-openmm
    notes: upstream package this work forks
